@startuml
[*] --> Idle : Card Inserted / Get PIN

state Idle
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state WaitingForCustomerChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting

Idle --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> ValidatingPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCustomerChoice : Valid PIN / Display Menu
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN, Card Stolen, Card Expired / Confiscate

Idle --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject
ValidatingPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> Ejecting : Cancel / Eject

WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingWithdrawal : Withdrawal Selected / Request Withdrawal, Display Wait
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingTransfer : Transfer Selected / Request Transfer, Display Wait
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> ProcessingQuery : Query Selected / Request Query, Display Wait

ProcessingWithdrawal --> Dispensing : Withdrawal Approved / Dispense Cash, Update Status
ProcessingWithdrawal --> Ejecting : Rejected / Eject

Dispensing --> Printing : Cash Dispensed / Print Receipt, Display Cash Dispensed, Confirm Cash Dispensed
Dispensing --> ClosedDown : Insufficient Cash / Eject

Printing --> Ejecting : Receipt Printed / Eject

Ejecting --> Terminating : Card Ejected / Display Ejected
Confiscating --> Terminating : Card Confiscated / Display Confiscated

Terminating --> Idle : After (Elapsed Time) [Closedown Not Requested]

state ClosedDown as "System Down"
ClosedDown : entry / Display System Down

@enduml
